// The Long Roll-Call [B] (bible 8.2, 4.2): Hollowvein. The families want their dead up; Kettil kept the boards on
// because the keystone under the mine is what broke it. At the pit-head (Rest_3): walk it down, or leave it buried.
// Walked: the walk goes down through the four rooms, a verse in each (bounds-walk.md §2, `BoundsWalks.Relay`); Runa
// stands in the room whose verse is due (Hollowvein_Runa_Down), the Collapse is the fourth verse (boss 6.4), and
// she waits at the bottom once it is walked (Hollowvein_Runa_After).

title: Hollowvein_Runa_Walk
---
<<if has_flag("emberdown.hollowvein.walked")>>
    Runa: Thirty-one. Thirty-one. I said it. I said the number. #still #face:grave #line:01fdcc6
    Runa: Every night I stopped the song before it. Not now. #still #face:grave #line:0a128eb
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("emberdown.hollowvein.buried")>>
    Runa: The boards stay. I'll still walk it alone, some nights. It doesn't hold. I know it doesn't. #still #face:grave #line:088a8ce
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("walk.hollowvein.begun")>>
    Runa: Down the boards. I'm ahead of you. I've been ahead of you twenty years. #still #face:grave #line:0cdc68d
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if not walk_known()>>
    Runa: You don't know the walk yet. Come to the bell. Nobody goes down there without the song. #still #face:wary #line:0f53fe7
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Runa: Every year since, I've walked the bounds of Hollowvein. Alone. At night. #still #face:grave #line:0114ee2
Runa: It never held. You can't hold a place by yourself. I'm asking. First time. #still #face:grave #line:06a9d18
Runa: Thirty-one names. We'll learn the rest walking. #still #face:grave #line:07d3a71
-> Then we walk it down. #line:0582c99
    <<voice warden emberdown>>
    Runa: Four verses. Six names a verse. On the fourth, something wakes. Keep the beat anyway. #face:wary #line:04692b6
    <<flag emberdown.hollowvein_opened 1>>
    <<flag emberdown.hollowvein.chosen 1>>
    <<walk hollowvein>>
-> Leave them buried, Runa. #line:04fc9b3
    <<voice surveyor emberdown>>
    Runa: Aye. Aye. I'll tell the families. They'll count you anyway. That's what we do. #face:grave #line:001fbe1
    <<flag emberdown.hollowvein.buried 1>>
    <<flag emberdown.hollowvein.decided 2>>
-> ... #line:0127363
    <<voice drift emberdown>>
    Runa: Take your time. They've waited twenty years. They're patient. I'm not. Ha. #still #face:bright #line:0b8e4c0
===

title: Hollowvein_Runa_After
---
<<if has_flag("emberdown.hollowvein.walked")>>
    <<jump Hollowvein_Runa_Walk>>
<<endif>>
Runa: Thirty-one. #face:grave #line:0f7877f
Runa: Thirty-one came up. I said it. The families have them now. #face:grave #line:044daa1
Runa: And there's a stone down there that hums. It's yours, if you want it. We don't. #face:wary #line:04dea37
<<flag emberdown.hollowvein.walked 1>>
<<flag emberdown.hollowvein.decided 1>>
<<flag keystone.hollowvein 1>>
===

title: Hollowvein_Runa_Down
---
<<if flag("walk.hollowvein.legs") == 0>>
    Runa: Aske's beam first. First in, last out, most days. Then Tolla's ladder. Then down. #still #face:grave #line:02f0197
<<elseif flag("walk.hollowvein.legs") == 1>>
    Runa: The lamps on these walls were theirs. One each. We light them with the names. #still #face:grave #line:0726ab9
<<else>>
    Runa: They worked this water to the knee. Nell kept the tally dry. Below's the bottom. #still #face:wary #line:0b35a92
<<endif>>
===
